# Trivy suppression file — read automatically by every trivy run in this repo.
#
# One CVE or finding ID per line, e.g.:
#
#   CVE-2024-12345
#   CVE-2024-12345 # java format string in bundled lib, not reachable — SW, 2026-01
#
# Also supports GoVulnCheck-style pseudo-IDs for Go, not relevant here.
# avd-... or AWS-... IDs cover Aqua VM MISCONFIGURATIONS, e.g.:
#
#   avd-aws-0107 # docker-compose mysql demo passwords, never deployed — see AGENTS.md
#
# Rules of engagement:
# - Every entry needs a one-line rationale and a date on the same line.
# - When a fix lands (dependency PR merged, image rebased), DELETE the line.
# - The weekly scheduled scan keeps re-testing the released image, so stale
#   suppressions don't hide regressions forever.

# CVE-2026-47884 # spring-webmvc RCE via XsltView path traversal — app serves no XSLT views; only fixed in Spring Framework 7.0.9 (no 6.2.x backport). Real fix = Boot 4.1.1 migration (Dependabot PR #16). SW, 2026-10-09
# CVE-2026-47890 # spring-webmvc/webflux SSE stream corruption with view resolution — app has no SSE view controllers; only fixed in Spring Framework 7.0.9. Real fix = Boot 4.1.1 migration. SW, 2026-10-09
